window.L1MS={"app_name":"Network X-Ray","og_sub":"Eight tests in one run, one grade, one link","a_logo":"1ms.dog","a_theme":"Theme","a_close":"Close","a_prev":"Previous","a_next":"Next","th_system":"Theme: system","th_light":"Theme: light","th_dark":"Theme: dark","intro":"Runs eight 1ms.dog tests in one go: what websites can tell about you, IP quality, exit IPs, IPv6, DNS, streaming and AI access, service latency and speed. Each tool measures and reports on its own, then everything adds up to one grade.","intro_time":"About 90 seconds. The speed test at the end uses some data.","auto_label":"Start when the page opens","start":"Start checkup","stop":"Stop","again":"Run again","running":"Checking","ph_1":"Identity, IP, exits, IPv6, DNS","ph_2":"Streaming & AI, latency","ph_3":"Speed","prog":"Step {n} of 3 · {text} · {s} s","prog_done":"Done in {s} s","prog_stopped":"Stopped","st_wait":"Queued","st_run":"Testing","st_done":"Done","st_timeout":"Timed out","st_error":"Failed","st_na":"Not available","st_stopped":"Stopped","sec_privacy":"Identity & privacy","sec_ipqs":"IP quality","sec_unlock":"Streaming & AI","sec_conn":"Connectivity","sec_speed":"Speed","v_running":"Checking your connection…","v_ap":"Excellent: a clean IP, everything works, it's fast and nothing leaks.","v_a":"Good: nothing serious, just a few small things to improve.","v_b":"Decent, with a few weak spots worth a look.","v_c":"So-so: several things need fixing.","v_d":"Poor: important checks failed, or something is leaking.","v_f":"Bad: most of the checks failed.","v_none":"Nothing finished, so there's no grade.","sub":"{done} of {all} tests finished · {w}% of the weight counted","missing":"Didn't finish: {list} (left out of the grade)","k_ipqs":"IP quality","k_unlock":"Services that work","k_down":"Download","k_up":"Upload","ph_run":"Step {n} of 3: {text}","tools_h":"Test details","tools_sum":"{done} of {all} done","tools_show":"Show each test","tools_hide":"Hide each test","k_running":"Testing","waiting":"Waiting for the results…","blocked_h":"An ad blocker (uBlock, AdGuard or similar) may have stopped the tests.","blocked_s":"Turn it off for 1ms.dog, or add 1ms.dog to its allowlist, then run the checkup again.","retry_blocked":"Retry with blocker off","cross_h":"Combined findings","full":"Full result","expand":"Show","collapse":"Hide","sec_none":"Didn't finish, so it isn't graded.","s_privacy_ok":"Websites see a consistent you: no leaks, nothing that doesn't add up.","s_privacy_warn":"A few details give you away. See below.","s_privacy_bad":"Websites may be able to see your real IP or location.","s_conn_ok":"IPv6, DNS and common services all connect, and quickly.","s_conn_warn":"Everything connects, but some parts are slower than they should be.","s_conn_bad":"Connection problems: slow DNS, slow services or IPv6 not working right.","x_hosting_tz":"Your IP belongs to a data center, but your system time zone is somewhere else, so sites can easily tell you're on a proxy. Set your time zone to match the exit's location to close that gap.","x_leak":"WebRTC is showing websites a second IP, which may be your real one. Turn on WebRTC leak protection in your browser or proxy app.","x_split":"Split routing is working: AI services go out through one country ({a}), streaming through another ({b}).","x_ai_blocked":"No AI service works: your exit IP is in a region where ChatGPT, Claude and similar services aren't offered ({cc}). Try a server in another country.","x_dns_region":"Your DNS resolver and exit IP are in different places (DNS: {a}, exit: {b}). Some sites can use that to spot a proxy.","x_bloat":"The line jams under load: latency jumps while downloading, and common services are slow too.","to_lag":"Find where it slows down","x_v6_slow":"IPv6 is slower than IPv4, so sites that prefer IPv6 load more slowly.","x_udp_blocked":"UDP can't get out and QUIC is blocked: video calls, games and HTTP/3 fall back to TCP or don't connect at all. Turn on UDP forwarding in your proxy app, or switch to a protocol that carries UDP.","x_udp_loss":"{loss}% of UDP packets are lost: video calls and games will stutter. The cause is usually the proxy or the route; try another server or line and test again.","x_tunnel_dc":"Your traffic goes through a tunnel (the MTU and MSS are smaller than on a plain line) and the IP belongs to a data center: sites can easily tell you're on a proxy. To look like an ordinary user, switch to a server with a residential IP.","x_blackhole":"There's a PMTU black hole: large packets are dropped silently, so some sites hang while loading. Set the MTU on your proxy or router to {mtu} or lower.","partial":"This link only has the summary, not the full details.","share":"Share","report_result":"Result seems wrong?","report_prompt":"This result seems wrong:","share_text":"My network checkup: {detail}. How does yours compare?","share_desc":"{n} tests in one run, overall grade {total}: identity and privacy, IP quality, streaming and AI, connectivity and speed. Check your own connection.","card_sub":"Eight tests in one run","mock_note":"Demo data, not a real measurement"};
